# Contested Game Ball: "{2}, {T}: Draw a card and put a point counter on this artifact. Then if it has five or more point counters
# on it, sacrifice it and create a Treasure token." Bot1 draws with it on turns 1, 3, 5 and 7 (four counters), and on turn 9
# Tezzeret's Gambit proliferates the fifth onto it: a counter put some other way does not sacrifice it (ruling 2023-11-10). Bot1
# then activates it and Bot2 Shatters it in response. The ability still draws, there is no Ball to put a counter on or to
# sacrifice, but the Ball as it last was had five point counters (CR 608.2h), so Bot1 still creates the Treasure.

